<title>USA: Simione Central year net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Simione Central year net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $1.85     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net	   loss	15,899     loss	   956</p>
<p> Revs			25,995		   13,222</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,990		    8,576</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Simione Central Holdings Inc said its 1996 results give effect to the acquisitions of the consulting division of Simione &amp; Simione, CPAs, which was completed in January 1996, and InfoMed Holdings Inc which was completed in October 1996.  The InfoMed results are included only from the effective acquisition date.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1996 includes a one-time accounting change charge of $13,788,600 which was primarily related to the acquisition of InfoMed.</p>
